{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56641","headline":"题闲处士隐居 · 无名氏","name":"题闲处士隐居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野老南湖上，茅檐向水低。\n应门仲躬子，举[案]（按）伯鸾妻。\n篱下山花笑，窗前谷鸟啼。\n犹言近人境，不似武陵溪。\n（《新撰类林钞》卷四，据小川环树本。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}